Commentary of al-Nasafi (Madarik al-Tanzil) on surah 73, verse 14:

﴿Yawm﴾ (the day), in the accusative, governed by what is in "ladayna" (with us), which carries the sense of a verb, meaning: there awaits the disbelievers with Us such-and-such on the day ﴿the earth and the mountains quake﴾, that is, move with a violent motion;

﴿And the mountains will be a heap of sand﴾, that is, a gathered mass of sand, derived from "kathaba al-shay'" (he gathered the thing) when he collected it. It is as if it is of the pattern "fa'il" in the sense of "maf'ul" (object-form);

﴿flowing﴾, that is, pouring down and running after it has been gathered.
